{"t":"Grimvale Mini World Change","s":"grimvale-mini-world-change-294ec","k":"quest","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Grimvale Mini World Change</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"time\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Time</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12<sup>th</sup>–15<sup>th</sup> of every month</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(100 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Mini World Change</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.80<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 21, 2015<br/>Summer Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>It is full moon on <a href=\"#/wiki/Grimvale\">Grimvale</a>, beware!\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Grimvale\">Grimvale</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p>All kinds of <a href=\"#/wiki/Lycanthropes\">Lycanthropes</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>Able to do the <a href=\"#/quest/grimvale-quest\">Grimvale Quest</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Messages\">Messages</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20World%20Board\">World Board</a>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">The full moon has a strange impact on the island of Grimvale. The small forest there seems darker, filled with nightly howls.</span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Towncryer\">Towncryer</a>: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">The full moon pale has risen over Grimvale. Help lift the curse, you won't be off worse!</span>\n</p><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Feroxa\">Feroxa</a> always spawns on the 13th of each month. <a href=\"#/wiki/Feroxa\">Feroxa</a> messages:\n</p>\n<ol><li><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Grimvale drowns in werecreatures as the full moon reaches its apex and ancient evil returns.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Half of the current full moon is visible now, there are still a lot of clouds in front of it.</span><br/><i>(This will be triggered between 16 and 18 minutes after the first message.)</i></li>\n<li><span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">The full moon is completely exposed: Feroxa awaits!</span><br/><i>(This will be triggered exactly 4 minutes after the previous message.)</i></li>\n<li>All characters in Feroxa's antechamber will be teleported and the boss battle will begin.<br/><i>(This will be triggered exactly 10 minutes after the previous message.)</i></li></ol>\n<p><b>Note:</b> Every time before facing Feroxa you have to fulfill the prerequisites of delivering 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Purple%20Nightshade%20Blossoms\">Purple Nightshade Blossoms</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Maeryn\">Maeryn</a> and kill 50 were-creatures as described in Grimvale Quest - The Curse of the Full Moon.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<p>From the <a href=\"#/wiki/Server%20Save\">Server Save</a> of the 12<sup>th</sup> to the server save of the 15<sup>th</sup> of each month, the full moon will rise over <a href=\"#/wiki/Grimvale\">Grimvale</a>. This means that the harmless Bandits inhabiting the island will turn into fearsome <a href=\"#/wiki/Lycanthropes\">Were-Creatures</a>! Take this opportunity to do the <a href=\"#/quest/grimvale-quest\">Grimvale Quest</a> and rid the normally peaceful island from this awful curse.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["grimvale-quest"]}